---
import { v9Href } from '~/data/v9/routes';
---

<section class="start g-white" id="start">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="start-head">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-v9-reveal style="justify-content:center"><span class="tick">\</span> Get started</div>
      <h2 data-v9-reveal style="--d:60ms">Tell us what’s broken.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="lead" data-v9-reveal style="--d:120ms">
      We’ll tell you what fixes it. The first call is 45 minutes, and if the answer is that you need none of this, we’ll
      say so. That has happened.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row" data-v9-reveal style="--d:180ms">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={v9Href('/__v9/contact', Astro.url.pathname)}>Book the first call</a>
      <a class="link" href={v9Href('/__v9/home#proof', Astro.url.pathname)}>See how a search runs ›</a>
    </div>
    <p class="start-note" data-v9-reveal style="--d:220ms">A named person reads every request.</p>
  </div>
</section>
